### VM env note (this branch)
- pytorch.org downloads blocked on this VM (TLS to download-r2.pytorch.org fails);
  used conda-forge libtorch instead: micromamba create -p /workspace/.libtorch-env -c conda-forge "libtorch=2.5.1=cpu_generic*"
  then cmake -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/workspace/.libtorch-env (folder is gitignored)

